      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Schedule 7,",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "item 4\nA single day to be fixed by Proclamation.\nHowever, if any of the provision(s) do not\ncommence within the period of 6 months\nbeginning on the day on which this Act\nreceives the Royal Assent, they commence\non the first day after the end of that period."
    },
