      "skos:note": "Applicant may modify application before Commission decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005#sch-7-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 After subsection 152AT(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) Before the Commission makes a decision under subsection (3) in\nrelation to the application, the applicant may, by written notice\ngiven to the Commission within the time allowed by the Procedural\nRules, modify the application, so long as the modification is a\nmodification that, under the Procedural Rules, is taken to be a\nmodification of a minor nature."
    },
