      "skos:note": "Commission may reject variation if carrier/provider fails to provide information within time limit.",
      "dc:description": "Information within time limit allowed by Procedural Rules"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005#sch-7-sec-14-2-ss-2a",
