      "skos:note": "Minister must consider ACCC's report and other relevant matters when deciding to make a declaration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005#sch-8-sec-47-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47(5) Designated interconnection services",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In deciding whether to make the declaration, the Minister must\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) the ACCC’s report; and\n\n(b) such other matters (if any) as the Minister considers relevant."
    },
