    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-69a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "69A Remedial directions—breach by Telstra of conditions relating",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005#sch-11-sec-69a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "to operational separation\n\n(1) This section applies if Telstra has contravened, or is contravening,\na condition set out in Part 8 of Schedule 1.\n\n(2) The ACCC may give Telstra a written direction requiring Telstra to\ntake specified action directed towards ensuring that Telstra does\nnot contravene the condition, or is unlikely to contravene the\ncondition, in the future.\n\n(3) The following are examples of the kinds of direction that may be\ngiven to Telstra under subsection (2):\n\nSchedule 11  Operational separation of Telstra",
      "skos:definition": "to operational separation\n\n(1) This section applies if Telstra has contravened, or is contravening,\na condition set out in Part 8 of Schedule 1.\n\n(2) The ACCC may give Telstra a written direction requiring Telstra to\ntake specified action directed towards ensuring that Telstra does\nnot contravene the condition, or is unlikely to contravene the\ncondition, in the future.\n\n(3) The following are examples of the kinds of direction that may be\ngiven to Telstra under subsection (2):\n\nSchedule 11  Operational separation of Telstra",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-69a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-69a-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-69a-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "96152a12e2b8c2dfdf4af489eea112cef6f33e09d86414f92cff65393c531089"
    },
    {
