      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A decision by the Australian Competition Tribunal:\n\n(a) affirming a section 69A direction; or\n\n(b) setting aside a section 69A direction; or\n\n(c) made in substitution for a section 69A direction; or\n\n(d) varying a section 69A direction;\nis taken, for the purposes of this Act (other than this section), to be\na decision of the ACCC.\nConduct of review",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A decision by the Australian Competition Tribunal:\n\n(a) affirming a section 69A direction; or\n\n(b) setting aside a section 69A direction; or\n\n(c) made in substitution for a section 69A direction; or\n\n(d) varying a section 69A direction;\nis taken, for the purposes of this Act (other than this section), to be\na decision of the ACCC.\nConduct of review",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005-sch-11-sec-69b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
