      "values:originalText": "(1) The aim of this Part is to promote the principles of transparency\nand equivalence in relation to the supply by Telstra of wholesale\neligible services.\nObjects",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The aim of this Part is to promote the principles of transparency\nand equivalence in relation to the supply by Telstra of wholesale\neligible services.\nObjects",
      "values:partOf": {
