      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-issues-act-2005.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a declared network service is a\nservice specified in a written determination made by the Minister\nunder this subclause.\n\n(2) A determination under subclause (1) is a legislative instrument for\nthe purposes of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a declared network service is a\nservice specified in a written determination made by the Minister\nunder this subclause.\n\n(2) A determination under subclause (1) is a legislative instrument for\nthe purposes of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003.",
