      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if Telstra has engaged in conduct in order to\ncomply with a final operational separation plan in force under\nPart 8 of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications Act 1997.\n\n(2) In performing a function, or exercising a power, under this Part in\nrelation to Telstra, the Commission must have regard to the\nconduct to the extent that the conduct is relevant.\n\nInterim determinations about access  Schedule 12\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Issues) Act 2005\nNo. 119, 2005            47"
    },
